 47K  c  1966Wi11: {+48}Ca(t,|a){+47}K reaction at E(t)=7.5 MeV with Si |DE-E   
 47K 2c  detector system. |a angular distribution was measured to deduce        
 47K 3c  J{+|p} of the ground and first excited states.                         
