 47V 2c  |g|g(|q)(DCO) using the 8|p array consisting of 20 HPGe detectors,     
 47V 3c  a BGO array, and particle-|g coincidences with a 44-element CsI        
 47V 4c  detector. Deduced lifetimes using Doppler Shift Attenuation            
 47V 5c  method (DSAM).                                                         
 47V  cG $Angular distributions (AD) and directional correlations of            
 47V 2cG oriented nuclei (DCO) measured at 37|' and 79|'. Excepted AD values of 
 47V 3cG |?0.8 for stretched dipole and of |?1.5 for J|)J dipole or stretched   
 47V 4cG quadrupole transition. The DCO ratio has values for stretched          
 47V 5cG dipole and quadrupole transitions of |?1 and |?1.5, respectively       
 47V 6cG dipole gated and |?0.5 and |?1 for quadrupole gated.                   
 47V  cG E$1998Ca26 provide general statement that uncertainty is 1 keV for     
 47V 2cG E|g<2 MeV and 2 keV for E|g>2 MeV.                                     
 47V  cG RI$Relative intensities. See Table III of 1998Ca26 for                 
