 47V  c  1986De13,1985DeZU measured yield curve, resonance energies, and        
 47V 2c  strengths (E(p)=430-1340 keV; Ge(Li), |g-x; {+27}Al(p,|g)              
 47V 3c  calibration); S(p) ({+66}Ga calibration source); |g's, |g(|q) (Ge(Li), 
 47V 4c  |g-x). DSAM. Shell-model calculations.                                 
 47V  c  1993Ca12 analyzed the data of 1986De13 using a nonmetric               
 47V 2c  multi-dimensional scaling method.                                      
 47V  c  Data from the works listed under "Others" have been retained only if   
 47V 2c  they complement the present work or were cited by 1986De13 in their    
 47V 3c  spin and parity arguments.                                             
 47V  c  1974Ri16: E(p)=1-4 MeV. Activation measurement using NaI detectors.    
 47V 2c  Deduced cross section and compared results to Hauser-Feshbach          
 47V 3c  calculations.                                                          
 47V  c  1981Ke09: E(p)=0.72 - 3.0 MeV. Measured total |g yields at 55|'.       
 47V 2c  Deduced cross section and compared results to Hauser-Feshbach          
 47V 3c  calculations.                                                          
 47V  c  1974Ri16: E(c.m.)|?1-4 MeV. Activation measurement;                    
 47V 2c  |g{+|+}-coincidence, NaI.                                              
 47V  c  1981Ke09: E=0.72-3.00 MeV. Measured total |g-ray yields (55|').        
 47V 2c  Deduced |s and <|sv>                                                   
 47V  c  Others: 1967Al18 (E(p)=1020-1365 keV), 1970Mc24 (E(p)=1363 keV),       
 47V 2c  1970Wi06 (E(p)=1095-1285 keV), and 1973Sc29 (E(p)=1546-1572 keV); see  
 47V 3c  1977Ha45 for a summary of these data. See 1986De13 for a comparison    
